    "Add Path… in Scan Options leaves paths out of the next scan. A nested exclusion is skipped without being entered; an exclusion at or above the scan root is ignored.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«إضافة مسار…» في «خيارات الفحص» يستبعد مسارات من الفحص التالي. يُتخطى الاستثناء المتداخل دون دخوله؛ ويُتجاهل الاستثناء عند جذر الفحص أو فوقه."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Path… in Scan Options leaves paths out of the next scan. A nested exclusion is skipped without being entered; an exclusion at or above the scan root is ignored."
          }
        },
        "en-XA": {
